; =====================================================================
; Chart of accounts MZML HOLDING LIMITED (RAK ICC, ICC20251044)
; Financial year 1: 15-12-2025 to 31-12-2026. Presentation currency AED.
; Pure holding company: no bank account (application January 2027), no revenue, costs advanced by MZML Holding B.V.
; Version 2 (2-11-2026) after the independent review (docs/review_rekeningschema.md).
; Account names in English since 3-11-2026; old Dutch names: docs/account_mapping_nl_en.md.
; Investments: non-monetary, recorded in EUR with the cost in AED (rate 31-12-2025), never revalued.
; Vendor loans and current accounts: monetary, revalued.
; Metadata as for XCL (note, vat, ct, related-party, ifrs, rgs). VAT: MZML Ltd is not VAT-registered, so n/a throughout.
; =====================================================================

